OL,3,GNEWSAFury vs Joshua fight to go ahead  
OL,4,Adespite objections over 3am finish     
OL,6,FA handful of residents had objected to 
OL,7,Fthe proposed late finish, raising      
OL,8,Fconcerns over noise, antisocial        
OL,9,Fbehaviour and public safety, but none  
OL,10,Fcame to the meeting.                   
